---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Sacred History: Gnostic Texts, Nag Hammadi & Western Esotericism"
  description="The public record of human spirituality is heavily redacted. Explore foundational texts of suppressed history through rigorous examination of manuscript evidence."
>
  <main class="site-wrapper section" style="padding-top: 40px; background: rgba(5, 10, 18, 1);">
      
    <nav class="shsq-wayfinding-conduit reveal" aria-label="Hub Navigation" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 50px auto; padding: 0 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail" style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; gap: 10px; color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        <li><a href="/the-escape-matrix/" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">&#8629; Master Grid</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--shsq-muted, #888888);">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page" style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6);">The Exoteric Archive: Sacred History</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="adjacent-node">
        <a href="/gnostic-gnosis/" style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); padding-bottom: 2px;">Engage Hub I &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="shsq-hub-hero reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
      <span class="archive-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 15px;">The Outer Circle &middot; Exoteric Archive</span>
      <h1 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); margin: 15px 0 25px 0;">Sacred History</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        The public record of human spirituality is heavily redacted. For nearly two millennia, the historical understanding of the religious movements collectively termed "Gnosticism" relied almost exclusively upon the polemical writings of their orthodox opponents. This archive explores the foundational texts of this suppressed history through a rigorous examination of manuscript evidence and translation provenance.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="shsq-cluster-grid reveal reveal-delay-1" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 60px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
        
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 35px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block;">Foundation</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">An Exoteric Archive</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          Explore the historical context, manuscript provenance, and cosmological mechanics of suppressed texts from the Nag Hammadi Library and the Western esoteric continuum.
        </p>
        <a href="/sacred-history/exoteric-archive/" class="gateway-link" style="display: block; padding: 12px 20px; background: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); color: #050A12; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease;">Enter the Source &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 35px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block;">Nag Hammadi</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">The Apocryphon of John: A Structural Analysis</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          A source-critical breakdown of the primary Sethian creation myth, detailing the emanation of the Pleroma, the demiurgic fault of Sophia, and the Antimimon Pneuma.
        </p>
        <a href="/sacred-history/apocryphon-of-john/" class="gateway-link" style="display: block; padding: 12px 20px; background: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); color: #050A12; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease;">Enter the Source &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 35px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block;">Nag Hammadi</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">The Reality of the Rulers</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          A syncretic retelling of the early Genesis myth focusing on the nature of the cosmic authorities holding humanity in bondage, and the challenge of Norea.
        </p>
        <a href="/sacred-history/reality-of-the-rulers/" class="gateway-link" style="display: block; padding: 12px 20px; background: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); color: #050A12; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease;">Enter the Source &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 35px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block;">Nag Hammadi</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">The Gospel of Thomas: Translation Provenance</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          Analyzing the 114 esoteric logia attributed to the living Jesus, focusing on the interior realization of the Kingdom of Light and the process of anamnesis.
        </p>
        <a href="/sacred-history/gospel-of-thomas/" class="gateway-link" style="display: block; padding: 12px 20px; background: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); color: #050A12; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease;">Enter the Source &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 35px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block;">Qumran Discoveries</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">The Dead Sea Scrolls &amp; The Essene Brotherhood</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          Revising the understanding of Second Temple Judaism through sectarian documents outlining a highly structured, deterministic dualism.
        </p>
        <a href="/sacred-history/dead-sea-scrolls/" class="gateway-link" style="display: block; padding: 12px 20px; background: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); color: #050A12; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease;">Enter the Source &rarr;</a>
      </article>

      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.3); background: rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.05); padding: 35px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block;">Apocryphal Tradition</span>
        <h3 style="color: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.6rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;">The Book of Enoch: Watchers &amp; Cosmic Transgression</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment, #E6E6E6); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          Tracing the illicit transmission of forbidden celestial knowledge and the origins of systemic cosmic dualism preceding the classical Gnostic Demiurge.
        </p>
        <a href="/sacred-history/book-of-enoch/" class="gateway-link" style="display: block; padding: 12px 20px; background: var(--shsq-gold, #C6A664); color: #050A12; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s ease;">Enter the Source &rarr;</a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <footer class="shsq-footer-note reveal reveal-delay-2" style="text-align: center; color: var(--shsq-silver, #B0B8C0); font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: italic; border-top: 1px solid rgba(198, 166, 100, 0.2); padding-top: 20px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px;">
      <p>History SQ: Decoding the Enneagrammatic Escape Plan &middot; Guided by Sophia Mysterion.</p>
    </footer>

  </main>
</Layout>